ce 421 is not divisible by 2 or 3, **gcd(421, 1296) = 1**\n\nThus, the fraction is in simplest form:\n\n$$\n\\frac{421}{1296}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### Final Answer\n\nAnswer: 1717<|im_end|>'], label: 1717, reward: {'score': 1.0, 'acc': True, 'pred': '1717'}
